{
  "title": "Amazing Buttery Argentinian Grape Nuts Pilaf",
  "description": "A buttery and creamy Argentinian dish featuring grape nut cereal, perfect for midnight cravings, and a vegetarian friendly option served in a scallop shell.",
  "cuisine": "Argentinian",
